Kalau tak berkesan, saya akan pergi.

00:10:34.399 --> 00:10:36.240
Baiklah. Jom ikut saya.

00:10:37.799 --> 00:10:38.759
Baiklah, baiklah.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.840
Jaga sahaja sikap anda.

00:10:45.919 --> 00:10:46.840
Mengenai ini...

